  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakabikila bantu banene bonso ba mu Isalele, bakadi ku mutu kua bisamba, ne tupitene tua bisumbu bia bantu tuakakuatshila mukelenge mudimu mu milongo yatu, ne tupitene tua bantu tshinunu ne tua bantu lukama, ne bakadi ku mutu kua bintu bionso bia mukelenge ne bimuna biandi ne bia bana bandi ne tuhita ne bena bukitu mu Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge Davidi wakajuka hanshi, wakimana ku makasa andi, wakamba ne, Unvuai, bana betu ne bantu banyi; meme nakadi ne bualu mu mutshima wanyi bua kuibakila mushete wa tshihungidi tshia mei a Yehowa nsubu wa kuikisha ne tshitekelu tshia muinshi mua makasa a Nzambi wetu; nakabanga kulongolola bintu bia kuasa nʼabi nsubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Nzambi wakangambila ne, Wewe kuena wibakila dina dianyi nsubu nansha, bualu bua wewe udi muena nvita, wakamatshisha mashi hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, wakansungula munkatshi mua bonso ba mu nsubu wa tatu wanyi, wakampingisha mu bukelenge bua Isalele tshiendelele; bualu bua yeye wakasungula Yuda bua kuikaleye ku mutu; wakasungula tshiota tshia tatu wanyi mu tshisamba tshia Yuda; munkatshi mua bana ba tatu wanyi yeye wakalesha diakalengele kundi bua kumpingisha mu bukelenge bua Isalele; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne munkatshi mua bana banyi balume (Nzambi wakumpa bana ba bungi) yeye wakasungula Solomo muanʼanyi bua kushikameye mu nkuasa wa bukelenge bua Yehowa ku mutu kua Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakangambila ne, Solomo muanʼebe neibake nsubu wanyi ne biendedi bianyi; bualu bua meme nakamusungula bua kuikaleye muanʼanyi, ne meme nengikale tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenjadike bukelenge buandi tshiendelele, biananukileye kutumikila mikenji yanyi ne mei anyi bu mudibi lelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku ku mesu kua Bena Isalele bonso ba mu tshisumbu tshia Yehowa, ne mu matshu a Nzambi wetu, nuenze, nukebe mikenji yonso ya Yehowa Nzambi wetu; bua nuenu nuhiane buloba ebu buimpe, bua nuenu nubushile bana benu bu buhianyi buabo tshiendelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe, muanʼanyi Solomo, Umanye Nzambi wa tatuʼebe, umukuatshile mudimu ne mutshima mutoke ne didikokela kudiye; bualu bua Yehowa udi ukebakeba mitshima ya bantu bonso; udi ujingulula meji onso adibo bela munda muabo; biwamukeba, neumuhete; kadi biwamulekela, yeye neakuhidie tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Udimuke biebe, bualu bua Yehowa wakukusungula bua wewe kuibaka nsubu udi mua kuikala muaba wandi wa tshijila; wikale ne bukole, wenze nsubu eu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Davidi wakaha Solomo muanʼandi luidi lua mbalanda wa ntempelo, ne lua nsubu wandi, ne lua bibutshilu biandi, ne lua nsubu ya ku mutu, ne lua nsubu ya munda muandi, ne lua muaba wa tshibuikilu tshia or; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne luidi lua ngenyi yandi yonso ya biendedi bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa, ne ya nsubu yandi yonso, ne ya bibutshilu bia mu nsubu wa Yehowa, ne ya bitekelu bia bintu bia tshijila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne ya milongo ya bakuidi ne Bena Lewi, ne ya midimu yonso ya mu nsubu wa Yehowa, ne ya mpanza yonso ya mu nsubu ya Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha bujitu bua mpanza ya or, ne bua mpanza ya mishindu yonso; ne bua mpanza ya argent, ne bua mpanza ya mishindu yonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha bujitu bua bitekelu bia minda bia or ne minda yabi kabidi, ne bua bitekelu bia minda bia argent wakidikisha bujitu bua tshitekelu ne tshitekelu ne bua muinda ne muinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha bujitu bua mesa a bidia bilesha, ku mesa ne mesa; ne bua argent ya mesa ne mesa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bua or ya bitubuidi bia munyinyi ne malonga ne makoho, ne bujitu bua or ya bihanza bionso, ne bua bihanza bia argent kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakidikisha bujitu bua or ya tshioshelu tshia musenga wa manananshi ne or ya kuenza nʼai luidi lua dikalu dia bakeluba bakadi bolola mahuahua abo, bakabuikila mushete wa tshihungidi tshia mei a Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakamba ne, Nakamanya malu au onso ku tshifundidi tshia tshianza tshia Yehowa tô ne ku bintu bionso bia mu luidi elu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Davidi wakambila Solomo muanʼandi ne, Wikale ne bukole ne mutshima wa dikima, wenze bualu ebu; kutshinyi, kuhangi bualu ebu; bualu bua Yehowa Nzambi, Nzambi wanyi mene, udi nʼebe; yeye kena ukuhanga, kena ukulekela tô ne hawashikisha mudimu eu wonso wa mu nsubu wa Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tangila milongo ya bakuidi ne ya Bena Lewi ya mu midimu yonso ya mu nsubu wa Nzambi; muntu yonso udi ne mutshima wa kuenza ne lungenyi lua kuenza midimu yonso neikale nʼebe; tupitene ne bantu bonso nebatumikile mikenji yebe yonso kabidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
